# Copy to fastlane/.env (gitignored — never commit real values).
# Values come from your App Store Connect API key. Role: Admin — a lesser role cannot create the
# cloud-managed distribution certificate and the export fails on 'No signing certificate "iOS Distribution"'.
# The key authenticates both the export (passed to xcodebuild) and the upload, so no Xcode account
# sign-in is needed. Walkthrough: supporting-files/ios-setup-runbook.md — the .p8 itself lives ONLY in
# ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/ and must never enter the repo.
ASC_KEY_ID=
ASC_ISSUER_ID=
ASC_KEY_PATH=~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8
